{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/016d32b126b28aa2546b58241c69afa9.avif?t=1771497382\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a biological war tore the world apart, lethal creatures overran what remained of civilization. We took shelter inside a collapsed tunnel, believing we had found temporary safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was something living in the hole down there. At first, it seemed harmless. Until it got hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We lost people before we understood the pattern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When fed, the creature produces a strange byproduct, a substance that can be refined into fuel. Fuel we desperately need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If we can keep it fed, we might be able to generate enough to reach the radio tower. And if the tower still works, it may be our only chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6dedcac08974c6513439235058d1f80b.poster.avif?t=1771497382\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6dedcac08974c6513439235058d1f80b.webm?t=1771497382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6dedcac08974c6513439235058d1f80b.mp4?t=1771497382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4d3d4d1eccde85244900d8b9d96c2109.avif?t=1771497382\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is swarming with mutated creatures\u2014every step is a risk, every shadow a threat. <br>In this world, surviving alone is hard. <br>But together... together, we stand a chance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.poster.avif?t=1771497382\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.webm?t=1771497382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.mp4?t=1771497382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/08d414dc21b0aa95d26743a9f89ec0db.avif?t=1771497382\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate via voice chat in the game online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Horror Looter</i>, <i>First Person</i>, <i>Co-Op Survival</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gathered materials to craft useful items like spears, shotguns, and healing bandages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, or with friends (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the radio tower \u2014 no matter what it takes. It\u2019s your only way to the safe zone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b1